#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:784
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Users"
msgstr "配置用户"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:787
#, fuzzy
msgid "Set the `root` user to the default class using:"
msgstr "使用以下命令将 `root` 用户设为默认类："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:791
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pw usermod root -L default\n"
msgstr "# pw usermod root -L default\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:796
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All user accounts that are not `root` will now require a login class.  The "
"login class is required, otherwise users will be refused access to common "
"commands.  The following `sh` script should do the trick:"
msgstr "现在，所有非 `root` 用户帐户都必须指定登录类。若未指定登录类，用户将无法使用常用命令。以下 `sh` 脚本可完成此操作："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:801
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# for x in `awk -F: '($3 >= 1001) && ($3 != 65534) { print $1 }' \\\n"
"\t/etc/passwd`; do pw usermod $x -L default; done;\n"
msgstr "# for x in `awk -F: '($3 >= 1001) && ($3 != 65534) { print $1 }' \\\n\t/etc/passwd`; do pw usermod $x -L default; done;\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:804
#, fuzzy
msgid "Next, drop the `nagios` and `www` accounts into the insecure class:"
msgstr "接下来，将 `nagios` 和 `www` 帐户设为不安全类："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:809
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# pw usermod nagios -L insecure\n"
"# pw usermod www -L insecure\n"
msgstr "# pw usermod nagios -L insecure\n# pw usermod www -L insecure\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:811
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the Contexts File"
msgstr "创建上下文文件"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:814
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A contexts file should now be created as [.filename]#/etc/policy.contexts#:"
msgstr ""
"接下来需要创建一个上下文文件。 您可以把下面的实例放到 <filename>/etc/policy."
"contexts</filename> 中："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:818
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# This is the default BIBA policy for this system.\n"
msgstr "# This is the default BIBA policy for this system.\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:821
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# System:\n"
"/var/run(/.*)?\t\t\tbiba/equal\n"
msgstr "# System:\n/var/run(/.*)?\t\t\tbiba/equal\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:823
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "/dev/(/.*)?\t\t\tbiba/equal\n"
msgstr "/dev/(/.*)?\t\t\tbiba/equal\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:826
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"/var\t\t\t\tbiba/equal\n"
"/var/spool(/.*)?\t\tbiba/equal\n"
msgstr "/var\t\t\t\tbiba/equal\n/var/spool(/.*)?\t\tbiba/equal\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:828
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "/var/log(/.*)?\t\t\tbiba/equal\n"
msgstr "/var/log(/.*)?\t\t\tbiba/equal\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:831
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"/tmp(/.*)?\t\t\tbiba/equal\n"
"/var/tmp(/.*)?\t\t\tbiba/equal\n"
msgstr "/tmp(/.*)?\t\t\tbiba/equal\n/var/tmp(/.*)?\t\tbiba/equal\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mac/_index.adoc:834
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"/var/spool/mqueue\t\tbiba/equal\n"
"/var/spool/clientmqueue\t\tbiba/equal\n"
